          "text": "No. Ball1 hits ball2, but the collision launches both balls off the floor. Ball1 rebounds rapidly backward, while ball2 flies over ball3 and enters the cup. Ball3 never moves.\n\nThe revision below uses softer ball contacts to avoid the explosive collision, moves the cup closer, and adds a shallow entrance ramp. It has not been re-simulated here.\n\n```xml\n<mujoco model=\"three_balls_into_a_cup\">\n  <compiler angle=\"degree\" inertiafromgeom=\"true\"/>\n  <option timestep=\"0.002\" gravity=\"0 0 -9.81\" integrator=\"implicitfast\" solver=\"Newton\" iterations=\"100\" cone=\"elliptic\"/>\n  <size njmax=\"1000\" nconmax=\"200\"/>\n\n  <visual>\n    <global offwidth=\"1280\" offheight=\"720\"/>\n    <headlight ambient=\"0.3 0.3 0.3\" diffuse=\"0.6 0.6 0.6\" specular=\"0.2 0.2 0.2\"/>\n  </visual>\n\n  <worldbody>\n    <light name=\"key_light\" pos=\"-1 -2 3\" dir=\"0.3 0.4 -1\" diffuse=\"0.8 0.8 0.8\"/>\n    <light name=\"fill_light\" pos=\"1 1 2\" dir=\"-0.3 -0.3 -1\" diffuse=\"0.4 0.4 0.4\"/>\n    <camera name=\"overview\" pos=\"0 -2 1.4\" xyaxes=\"1 0 0 0 0.57 0.82\" fovy=\"42\"/>\n\n    <geom name=\"floor\" type=\"plane\" pos=\"0 0 0\" size=\"3 2 0.1\" rgba=\"0.82 0.84 0.86 1\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.6 0.003 0.001\" solref=\"0.02 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" priority=\"1\"/>\n\n    <body name=\"ball1\" pos=\"-0.45 0 0.05\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball1_free\"/>\n      <geom name=\"ball1_sphere\" type=\"sphere\" size=\"0.05\" mass=\"0.1\" rgba=\"0.85 0.16 0.12 1\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.6 0.003 0.001\" solref=\"0.03 0.3\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <body name=\"ball2\" pos=\"-0.15 0 0.05\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball2_free\"/>\n      <geom name=\"ball2_sphere\" type=\"sphere\" size=\"0.05\" mass=\"0.1\" rgba=\"0.95 0.65 0.08 1\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.6 0.003 0.001\" solref=\"0.03 0.3\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <body name=\"ball3\" pos=\"0.15 0 0.05\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball3_f